1:# Screen Spec - organizer-fee-paid-checkbox-20261005
2:
3:Target: organizer `Đăng ký & Vận động viên` tab, the participant table.
4:
5:## Before
6:
7:```text
8:| Team / pair | Members | Status |        PAYMENT  (+)        |
9:| Đội A       | ...     |   ✓    |   ( ● )  green tick badge  |
10:| Đội B       | ...     |   !    |   ( × )  grey cross badge  |
11:```
12:
13:Read-only badge.
14:
15:## After
16:
17:```text
18:| Team / pair | Members | Status |      PAYMENT  (+)      |
19:| Đ�i A       | ...     |   ✓    |   [x]                  |  <- captured in system
20:| Đội B       | ...     |   ✓    |   [x]                  |  <- manual mark
21:| Đội C       | ...     |   ✓    |   [ ]                  |
22:```
23:
24:- The checkbox is `h-5 w-5`, directly clickable, with an `aria-label` naming the team,
25:  so it is readable by a screen reader and large enough to hit reliably.
26:- A small `PAYMENT` caption sits under the box only when the fee was really captured
27:  through the system. That is the visual tell for "this one has money behind it".
28:- The tooltip states the captured amount when there is one.
29:
30:## Confirmation: unticking a manual mark
31:
32:```text
33:+--------------------------------------+
34:| (i) Clear the paid mark          [x] |
35:| This profile has no payment recorded  |
36:| in the system. Clearing the tick only |
37:| removes the paid mark; no refund is   |
38:| created and nothing financial changes.|
39:|        [Cancel]   [Clear mark]       |
40:+--------------------------------------+
41:```
42:
43:Neutral variant, blue action. Says plainly that nothing financial happens.
44:
45:## Confirmation: unticking a system payment
46:
47:```text
48:+------------------------------------------+
49:| (!) Clear the mark and request a refund[x] |
50:| This profile was paid through the system. |
51:| Clearing the tick creates a refund        |
52:| request. You still have to send the money |
53:| back to the athlete and submit proof for  |
54:| an admin to confirm.                      |
55:|      [Cancel] [Clear and request refund]  |
56:+------------------------------------------+
57:```
58:
59:Danger variant, red action. Names the consequence, does not quote an amount the client
60:cannot know, and does not claim the refund is already settled.
61:
62:## Ticking
63:
64:No dialog. It cannot move money, and the organizer can untick again immediately.
65:A toast confirms `Marked as paid outside the system.`
66:
67:## Responsive behaviour
68:
69:The table already scrolls horizontally below `min-w-[680px]`. The checkbox column is
70:last and sized by its content, so nothing reflows on narrow screens.

