[web/changes/organizer-fee-paid-checkbox-20261005/05-button-state-matrix.md#D36C]
1:# Button State Matrix - organizer-fee-paid-checkbox-20261005
2:
3:## Payment checkbox
4:
5:| Condition | Rendered | Interaction |
6:|---|---|---|
7:| `isPaid === true` | checked | click opens the confirmation |
8:| `isPaid === false` | unchecked | click applies immediately |
9:| Its own request is in flight | current value, `disabled` | inert, prevents double submit |
10:| Another row's request is in flight | normal, enabled | independent rows do not block each other |
11:| Participant is REJECTED / KICKED / DISQUALIFIED | normal | the backend is the authority and returns a clear message; the row is not pre-blocked because a fee may still need correcting |
12:
13:## Confirmation actions
14:
15:| Button | Condition | Result |
16:|---|---|---|
17:| `Clear mark` (neutral) | unticking a fee with no system payment | clears the flag, no refund row |
18:| `Clear and request refund` (danger) | unticking a fee captured through the system | clears the flag and raises one `PENDING_REFUND` request |
19:| `Cancel` | always | closes, changes nothing, checkbox keeps its old value |
20:| `X` / `Esc` | always | same as Cancel |
21:
22:## Feedback
23:
24:| Outcome | Feedback |
25:|---|---|
26:| marked paid | toast `Marked as paid outside the system.` |
27:| cleared, no payment | toast `Cleared the paid mark.` |
28:| cleared, refund raised | toast `Refund requested. Send the money back to the athlete, then submit proof for an admin to confirm.` |
29:| backend error | toast with the server message; the checkbox snaps back because the list is refetched and the row is never optimistically mutated |
30:
31:## Unchanged controls in this table
32:
33:Approve, reject, kick, seed edit, roster lock and the mock-athlete `+` button are
34:untouched. The `+` still adds fixture athletes; it does not grant a paid mark.

