112:   * participant would hand every MAIN/RESERVE team-mate their score without them
113:   * ever agreeing.
114:   *
115:   * Only the player themself may set this — an organizer-facing version would
116:   * defeat the whole rule, which exists so nobody can be force-enrolled and then
117:   * have results land against them.
118:   *
119:   * Idempotent on purpose: once the timestamp exists it is NEVER rewritten.
120:   * Re-stamping it on a repeat click would push the scoring boundary forward and
121:   * let a player un-score matches they had already agreed to have counted.
122:   */
123:  async confirmRankingConsent(tournamentId: string, userId: string) {
